sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser (index.html)
  participant F as Flask (server.py)
  participant R as Retrieval (rag_engine.py)
  participant L as LM Studio / OpenAI
  B->>F: POST /api/ask_stream {frage, mode, provider}
  F-->>B: event: status · "[[Handbuch wird durchsucht|Searching the manual]]"
  F->>R: retrieve(frage)
  R-->>F: [[Kontext, gedeckt, Quelle|context, grounded, source]]
  F-->>B: event: meta · {reference, mode, provider}
  alt [[nicht gedeckt|not grounded]]
    F-->>B: event: result · [[Ablehnungstext|refusal text]]
  else [[gedeckt|grounded]]
    F->>L: chat.completions(messages, stream=true, temperature=0)
    loop [[je Token|per token]]
      L-->>F: delta
      F-->>B: event: token · "…"
    end
    F->>F: parse_ai_response(text)
    F-->>B: event: result · {tts_summary, results, sources, usage}
  end
  F-->>B: data: [DONE]
